<title>PHILIPPINES: Benpres sees 200 bln peso outlay in water.</title>
<headline>Benpres sees 200 bln peso outlay in water.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Benpres Holdings Corp said on Thursday it and consortium partner Lyonnaise des Eaux SA will invest some 200 billion pesos over the next 25 years in Manila's water supply system.</p>
<p>The consortium, which earlier on Thursday won one of two 25-year privatisation contracts of the city's Metropolitan Water and Sewerage System (MWSS), said in a statement that about 10 billion pesos would be required in the first five years.</p>
<p>It said it planned to raise the funds for the first five years through a combination of equity and debt, but gave no other details.</p>
</text>
